OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA very windy day with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof heavy rain associated with Storm
OL,7,FAusten. These slowly clear towards the
OL,8,Fnortheast through the day leaving
OL,9,Fbrighter spells and isolated showers.
OL,10,FDisruptive winds throughout, reaching
OL,11,Fstorm force in the far southwest at
OL,12,Ffirst.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FIsolated showers continue
OL,15,Fthrough the night before rain arrives
OL,16,Fin the far southwest around dawn.
OL,17,FWinds slowly ease through the evening,
OL,18,Falthough remaining gusty around
OL,19,Fshowers throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
