OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother wet and windy day as
OL,6,FStorm Boelo pushes in from the west.
OL,7,FWidespread heavy rain and disruptive
OL,8,Fwinds, these reaching severe gale
OL,9,Fforce along coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,12,Fdrier, brighter day on Sunday although
OL,13,Fremaining windy until evening.
OL,14,FUnsettled conditions return at the
OL,15,Fstart of the week with rain and strong
OL,16,Fwinds arriving early Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
